TRISO-ATOPS attribution notice
===============================

The `boon-lay::triso_atops_fork` module is a Rust fork/port of TRISO-ATOPS
(TRISO Analysis TOol for Predictive Source terms), an open-source (MIT)
continuum/Eulerian TRISO fission-product source-term code from Idaho National
Laboratory.

Upstream project : TRISO-ATOPS
Upstream URL     : https://github.com/IdahoLabResearch/TRISO-ATOPS
Upstream commit  : de374c881743938c25c01a71a9adb8fbfd488f95 ("de374c8")
Upstream license : MIT (see LICENSE.triso-atops in this directory)
Date accessed    : 2026-07-15

The ported Rust module is distributed under GPL-3.0 as part of the combined
`boon-lay` work; the upstream MIT copyright and this notice are retained per the
MIT license terms. MIT is GPLv3-compatible, so this combination is permitted.

