The physics equations used in TRISO-ATOPS originate from the NP-MHTGR New
Production Reactor Program (1989):
  E. Anderson et al., "Generic Reactor Plant Description and Source Terms
  Volume 1," EG&G Idaho Inc., Idaho Falls, 1989.
Half-life data are from the IAEA Live Chart of Nuclides.
